Package: ak-direct-print
Version: 1.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Aktiv Software <odoo@aktivsoftware.com>
Homepage: https://www.aktivsoftware.com
Depends: cups, cups-client, avahi-utils, python3-gi, gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: AK Direct Print - Local Print Agent for Odoo
 Bridges Odoo (including Odoo.sh and Odoo Online) to printers on the
 client's local network. Runs silently in the system tray and receives
 print jobs from the browser, forwarding them to CUPS or IPP printers.
 .
 Features:
  - System tray icon with green/red status indicator
  - Auto-starts on user login
  - Supports CUPS and direct IPP (WiFi/AirPrint) printers
  - Works with Odoo On-Premise, Odoo.sh, and Odoo Online
